WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:03.240
Every stock you look at is a quiet
prediction.

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:06.450
Stocktrails shows you how those picks
really played out.

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:09.960
As you research, a small card appears
right on the page.

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:12.230
Label your outlook with one click

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:14.220
and mark whether you took a position.

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:15.390
Add a target,

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:17.890
a time horizon, and a line about why.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.610
It only takes a few seconds.

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:22.700
Back in your dashboard, every stock you
have researched

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:24.990
is tracked from the moment you first
looked.

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:27.790
Click any name to see your labeled views
on its chart,

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:29.260
right next to the NASDAQ.

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:31.920
Then turn your attention into an index

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:33.710
and see how it would have performed.

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:38.980
Below the chart, you get the full
statistics: returns, risk,

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.820
drawdown, and how you compare with the
market.

00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:44.040
My Habits shows how you really research,

00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:47.710
how focused you are, your streaks, and
when you are most active.

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:52.000
See how your attention lines up with the
market and with the Stocktrails community.

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:55.410
Trends and breakdowns reveal exactly where
your time goes.

00:00:55.770 --> 00:00:59.350
Every call you make is scored against your
own target and deadline.

00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:03.010
See which calls have resolved and what
edge you have over the market.

00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:04.990
Then see how you stack up:

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:10.000
your ranking among all users, and how
closely your research overlaps with the
crowd.

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:15.100
Explore an index of the community's most
researched stocks next to your own

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:17.330
and see what is trending right now.

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:18.980
Stocktrails.

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:21.860
Turn browsing into insight.

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:24.190
Add it to Chrome today.

00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:27.660
Start learning from every minute of
research.
